[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0031","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0377","title":"Oracle Solaris INETD 进程表拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Unix 系统存在进程表攻击漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发起大量网络服务连接请求，耗尽系统进程表资源，导致系统无法接受新的连接请求，从而引发拒绝服务。该漏洞利用方式简单，无需认证即可实施攻击，影响各类 Unix 操作系统。攻击者只需建立大量并发连接即可触发，属于典型的资源耗尽型拒绝服务漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0377"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:15Z","remediation":"建议将 inetd 替换为 xinetd，并在配置中添加连接速率限制，如 `cps = 25 30` 和 `per_source = 5`；同时通过 `/etc/system` 或 `ulimit` 调大系统进程表上限（如 `max_nprocs`），并使用 TCP Wrappers（`/etc/hosts.allow`）限制仅允许可信来源 IP 连接网络服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1033881","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d92a0abc5d3abac6dcdfabfef6fd71c158e0fd8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0377.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0377","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0377.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8c57fab4f71bd6fdcec1202e5361e2a9805c4950/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0377.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6eca843f42fd99fea8c9b630931afac7c9d4576c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w9p9-j3v6-q4vf/GHSA-w9p9-j3v6-q4vf.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0377.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x78000/77236/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000542.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0898","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0898.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1049","title":"Computer Associates ARCserve NT 弱加密密码嗅探漏洞","description":"计算机 Associates ARCserve NT 的代理服务在端口 6050 上使用简单的异或（XOR）弱加密方式处理认证口令，而非安全的加密算法。由于加密强度极低，处于网络位置的远程攻击者可嗅探捕获客户端发往代理的认证请求数据包，进而通过异或运算逆向还原出明文密码。该漏洞影响运行 ARCserve NT 及其代理组件的相关 Windows 系统，攻击者无需身份认证，只需能够与目标主机的 TCP 6050 端口进行网络嗅探与交互即可利用，成功后可获取代理访问权限，进而可能进一步控制备份服务及所在主机，危害等级达到严重（CVSS 10.0）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1049"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-21T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:35Z","remediation":"建议升级至 ARCserve 官方修复版本（如 ARCserveIT 6.61 或更高版本），采用强加密算法替代弱 XOR 密码加密机制。若无法立即升级，应通过防火墙限制对 6050 端口的访问，仅允许可信主机连接，并在受信任的隔离网络段内部署备份代理，避免明文认证请求在网络中被嗅探破解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91972006211238&w=2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50cb0f51a2a6988cb2c3b9e8c611d8b1e75d6a00/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1049.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1049","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1049.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a31d2f5a71538913547927468112ac9591961ea3/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1049.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/6da213119b3c54637329347c0dc42c66b8a84f0a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9729-phqg-qhx6/GHSA-9729-phqg-qhx6.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1049.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88510/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c62739a4-d1c3-4ed5-ba06-12f0d9925391.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/6148a0a4de84d6ec56846d6a6959a09894a7df0c/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0898.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0029","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0376","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 KnownDLL 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 的 KnownDLLs 注册表项 HKLM\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager\\KnownDLLs 存在权限配置不当，允许本地普通用户进行写入修改。攻击者可利用该漏洞将 KnownDLLs 列表指向恶意的动态链接库文件，当系统或应用程序加载对应 DLL 时，恶意代码将以 SYSTEM 权限执行，最终实现本地权限提升。该漏洞主要影响 Windows NT 4.0 SP4 及更早版本，成功利用需要攻击者具备本地登录能力并能修改目标注册表键值。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0376"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-02-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:15Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 提供的 MS99-006 热修复补丁，该补丁将 KnownDLLs 列表的默认权限修改为只读，阻止普通用户篡改 DLL 映射。如无法安装补丁，可临时通过注册表将 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager 下的 ProtectionMode 设为 REG_DWORD 值 1 以启用系统基对象保护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-006","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19198","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f4ffb7bcd93209aa53a757a7ebdf17fe2a18eb33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0376.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0376","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0376.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcb2bc8aed064ca80cf72b28e99ae813ae48a2c2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0376.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m2f4-5w48-qvv5/GHSA-m2f4-5w48-qvv5.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/763b4dfa75aa1890a155aad1b583fdcab8111c49/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0376.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--ac51be8d-690a-423c-a24b-48567a71d0ec.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0997","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0997.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1168","title":"ISS Internet Security Scanner 5.3 for Linux install.iss 安装脚本符号链接漏洞","description":"Internet Security Scanner (ISS) 5.3 for Linux 版本中的 install.iss 安装脚本在处理临时文件时存在符号链接攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在临时文件创建前放置符号链接，利用该脚本以运行脚本的权限（通常为 root）修改任意文件权限，导致权限提升或系统文件被篡改。攻击条件为拥有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1168"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"1999-02-20T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该产品版本已停止维护，建议避免以 root 权限运行 install.iss 脚本；使用专用临时目录并设置粘滞位（sticky bit）防止符号链接攻击；考虑迁移至受支持的替代安全扫描方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T05:44:46Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12640"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0997.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1129","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1129.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1482","title":"SVGAlib zgv 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"SVGAlib zgv 3.0 至 7 及更早版本中存在权限泄露漏洞。zgv 是一款基于 SVGAlib 的图片查看工具，在处理子进程时未正确隔离 iopl(3) 特权级别。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞，通过运行特制的恶意程序继承父进程的高权限 I/O 操作权限，进而获取 root 权限。该漏洞需本地用户认证且低权限可用，影响 Linux 系统下使用 SVGAlib zgv 的环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1482"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:32Z","remediation":"升级 zgv 至 3.0-8 或更高版本，该版本修复了 iopl(3) 权限泄露至子进程的问题。如无法升级，建议移除 zgv 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/zgv），或限制仅受信任用户可通过 SVGAlib 执行图形程序，避免本地低权限用户利用该漏洞提权至 root。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&date=1999-02-15&msg=Pine.LNX.3.96.990219175605.9622A-100000%40ferret.lmh.ox.ac.uk","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/559e7878a2bcd153513c59154e730dfe23ee3b94/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1482.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1482","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1482.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ed836d32ec0f7204df361b2aedfef822b3e814e/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1482.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-r372-p99p-584j/GHSA-r372-p99p-584j.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87964/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1482.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000538.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1024","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1255","title":"Hyperseek 远程配置修改漏洞","description":"Hyperseek 搜索工具的管理接口存在未授权访问漏洞，远程攻击者无需任何认证即可直接调用 admin.cgi 程序并传入 edit_file 动作参数，从而修改 Hyperseek 的系统配置。该漏洞影响 Hyperseek 所有版本，攻击者可利用此漏洞篡改搜索配置、重定向搜索结果或植入恶意内容，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议限制 admin.cgi 的访问权限或移除该管理接口。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1255"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:02Z","remediation":"Hyperseek 已停止维护，建议立即从服务器上彻底卸载该软件。如因历史原因暂时无法卸载，应通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 .htaccess 或 Nginx 的 deny 规则）限制对 admin.cgi 的访问来源 IP，或移除 admin.cgi 文件的执行权限（chmod -x admin.cgi）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.rootshell.com/archive-j457nxiqi3gq59dv/199902/hyperseek.txt.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1914","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1255.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1255","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1255.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1255.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5hp3-5xjh-3v56/GHSA-5hp3-5xjh-3v56.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87851/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1255.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/28a6d08daac937b384e80635b6d3e669d1c826ac/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0125","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0460","title":"Linux Kernel autofs 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux autofs 内核模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可通过构造超长目录名触发该漏洞，导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux Kernel 2.0/2.1/2.2 版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限，利用门槛较低。由于 autofs 模块在处理目录名时未正确校验长度边界，精心构造的超长路径可造成内核缓冲区溢出，使系统崩溃或服务不可用。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0460"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:26Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 2.2.13 及以上版本，该版本修复了 autofs 模块处理超长目录名时的缓冲区溢出问题。如无法升级内核，可禁用 autofs 服务（`/etc/init.d/autofs stop && chkconfig autofs off`）作为临时缓解措施，限制本地用户对 autofs 挂载点的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/312","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19250","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1231f6f5f21cc87f3264c90adadd01cbb12e76ba/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0460.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0460","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0460.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1d279cde1e5f7d9e150ca373126c9b35476ad3f5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0460.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/18de81c56daca1c9e33223f0b95bdb8312a1ca75/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3x2r-qgjm-w8gr/GHSA-3x2r-qgjm-w8gr.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0460.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1ede0e30-6079-4e58-933d-9578d5e55b3b.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000534.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0125.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0125.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0058","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0058.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0412","title":"Microsoft IIS 2.0/3.0/4.0 ISAPI GetExtensionVersion 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 2.0/3.0/4.0 的 ISAPI 扩展处理机制存在漏洞，当服务器以 SYSTEM 权限运行并加载 ISAPI 扩展时，远程攻击者可向目标发送特制请求，利用 GetExtensionVersion() 处理流程中的缺陷以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意命令。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，完全控制受影响服务器，危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0412"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:20Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Windows 2000 附带的 IIS 5.0 或更高版本，避免以 SYSTEM 账户运行 IIS 并限制 ISAPI 扩展加载权限；如无法升级，可禁用不必要的 ISAPI 扩展并降低应用程序映射权限。该漏洞已在 1999 年通过 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-013 修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/501","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19376","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/6e5939e8074723d33adaf5b2f8b0352edab9ba8d/1999/CVE-1999-0412.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e6f80460dd56d97b6079eb72c9467b9a961ce1b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0412.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0412","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0412.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0412.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g4g4-39cv-vpgv/GHSA-g4g4-39cv-vpgv.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0412.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0412.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/opsxcq/mirror-vxheaven.org/blob/4675a2c53cbb825974e4df213a6b129d5d52c764/vxheaven.org/index.php%3Fdetails=706"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0058.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0058.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0058.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0051","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0406","title":"Digital Unix Networker nsralist 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Digital Unix（Tru64 UNIX）操作系统中 Networker 备份管理工具的 nsralist 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该程序发送特制的超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，覆盖内存中的关键数据结构，成功利用后可获取 root 权限，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响 Digital Unix 多个版本，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0406"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-19T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:19Z","remediation":"建议升级 Digital Unix 至 4.0F 及以上版本，或安装 Compaq 针对 nsralist 缓冲区溢出漏洞发布的 Tru64 UNIX 安全补丁 (SSRT-1999-01)。作为缓解措施，使用 chmod 700 限制 nsralist 二进制文件仅允许 root 执行，并从本地用户中移除对 Networker 程序组的非必要成员权限，同时通过 ACL 限制受影响服务的交互式登录用户范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0406"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1088","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1372","title":"Triactive Remote Manager 明文存储认证凭据致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"TriActive Remote Manager 在启用 Basic 认证时，将用户登录凭据（用户名和密码）以明文形式写入 Windows 注册表键值 HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\TriActive\\Remote Manager\\ 中。本地攻击者通过读取注册表即可获取明文凭据，进而利用这些凭据提升权限或横向移动。该漏洞的攻击前提是攻击者已获得本地系统访问权限，危害等级为中危，影响 TriActive Remote Manager 使用 Basic 认证的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1372"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-02-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 Triactive Remote Manager 认证方式从 Basic 切换为 Challenge and Response（用户级访问控制），避免明文密码写入注册表；限制 HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\TriActive\\Remote Manager\\ 注册表键的访问权限，仅允许管理员账户读取；如无需远程管理功能，建议卸载该软件或禁用服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91966339502073&w=2"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0941","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0941.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1101","title":"Kabsoftware Lydia 密码弱加密存储漏洞","description":"Kabsoftware Lydia 工具使用弱加密算法将用户密码存储在 lydia.ini 配置文件中，本地攻击者可轻易解密密码文件，从而获取提升的权限。该漏洞源于加密强度不足，攻击者无需认证即可在本地利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1101"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-02-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 Kabsoftware Lydia 的修复版本，或使用更强的加密方案替代原有的弱加密算法存储密码。如无法升级，应限制对 lydia.ini 文件的本地访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:17:49Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12618"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0941.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0158","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0158.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0485","title":"OpenBSD 2.4 ipintr 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 2.4 内核网络协议栈中的 ipintr() 函数在处理 IP 碎片重组队列（ipq）时存在缺陷，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形 IP 数据包触发该漏洞，导致内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.4 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，但需要一定的网络条件。CVSS v2 评分为 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0485"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-19T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-02-19T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级到 OpenBSD 2.5 或更高版本。如无法升级，请为 OpenBSD 2.4 依次安装 maxqueue 补丁、tcp decoding 补丁和 ipintr 补丁（编号 006），补丁可从 ftp.openbsd.org/pub/OpenBSD/patches/2.4/common/ 获取。也可在边界防火墙上限制对受影响主机的 IP 分片流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0158.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1133","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1133.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1495","title":"SuSE Linux xtvscreen 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.0 中的 xtvscreen 组件存在任意文件写入漏洞，由于程序在处理 pic000.pnm 临时文件时未进行安全的符号链接检查，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意的符号链接指向系统任意文件，诱使 xtvscreen 将内容写入目标文件，从而覆盖系统关键文件或用户数据。该漏洞需要本地攻击权限，攻击复杂度低，影响 SuSE Linux 6.0 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1495"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-02-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:33Z","remediation":"升级 SuSE Linux 至 6.1 及以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可删除 xtvscreen 的 setuid 权限（chmod -s /usr/bin/xtvscreen），或限制普通用户对 /tmp 目录的写权限以阻止符号链接攻击。同时建议使用 mktemp 等安全临时文件创建方式替代硬编码的 pic000.pnm 路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/12580","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/325","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1792","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b172e0393d29bddb2ceeda5ce57e29123589a55b/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1495.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1495","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1495.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9a5386d000a40888283d918a46b8928ffcbfca7b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1495.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fe37e86b4ab6d44c1acc95d76e30f97043bfd67f/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-292w-467q-qfj8/GHSA-292w-467q-qfj8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1495.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000531.txt","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/linux.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0050","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0050.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0405","title":"Linux Lsof 本地缓冲区溢出提权漏洞","description":"Lsof（List Open Files）工具在处理超长命令行参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞以 root 权限执行任意代码。受影响系统包括 Debian 2.0、FreeBSD 3.2、OpenBSD 2.4、RedHat 5.2 及 SuSE 6.1 等版本，危害等级高。攻击者需具备目标系统的本地访问权限，即通过本地账号登录后运行特制的 lsof 命令即可触发漏洞，无需额外认证条件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0405"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1999-02-18T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:48:19Z","remediation":"tags. The user asked for the answer to be between <value> and","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/3163","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19374","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f4ffb7bcd93209aa53a757a7ebdf17fe2a18eb33/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0405.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0405","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/45be3b4afd9c4397ee32a5cbf6819a590220b0c1/content/CVE-1999-0405.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a75ebb477762f54f32c38d85ec939339ec2712e5/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0405.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e434c1da6464de3012c6c1eff8c0e19ef9669023/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-72r6-cpj9-gh8x/GHSA-72r6-cpj9-gh8x.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153300_153400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3d8f7267-453f-418a-8f3b-092d47e9d29f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1099","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1405","title":"IBM AIX snap 不安全的临时文件创建漏洞","description":"IBM AIX 4.2.1 及之前版本中的 snap 命令存在不安全临时文件创建漏洞。snap 在执行时会在 /tmp/ibmsupt 目录下创建临时文件，但该目录权限设置为世界可读，且执行 snap -a 后不会清理或删除该目录及其中内容。本地攻击者可利用此竞态条件，在 root 用户运行 snap -a 之前提前创建 /tmp/ibmsupt/general/passwd 符号链接指向 /etc/security/passwd，导致系统 shadow 口令文件以可读权限暴露，从而获取其他用户的密文密码。该漏洞需本地 shell 访问权限，影响 AIX 4.2.1 及更早版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1405"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-02-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:22Z","remediation":"升级到 AIX 4.3.2 或更高版本，该版本修复了 snap 命令创建 /tmp/ibmsupt 目录时权限设置不安全且未清理临时文件的问题。如无法升级，可在执行 snap -a 前手动删除 /tmp/ibmsupt 目录，或通过文件系统 ACL 限制普通用户对 /tmp/ibmsupt 的访问权限。也可安装 IBM 官方 APAR 补丁 IX84267。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91936783009385&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91954824614013&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/375","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19300","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1405.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1405","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1405.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1405.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gcvv-4h27-hqp8/GHSA-gcvv-4h27-hqp8.json","https://github.com/lcashdol/advisories/blob/32733f854e018593b94f048e59ce3442a76d2767/advisory-9.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1405.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/375/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--a32a8be3-115e-4d1a-b931-1ab3b612dbd1.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1099.toml"}]